    "status": "blueprint",
    "variant": "humanlike",
    "part": "skullbone",
    "changelog": "v2: Canvas-accurate shapes. Faceplate inset 1.7px, jaw top y=7, 14.4w. Renamed canvas cheek_bone \u2192 jawpoint/masseter. Added zygomatic cheekpoints (\u00b19.5, 4) with independent rotation + cone stems. Added cranial panes, cheek panes."
